# Scoped registries for Canva packages (used by @canva-ct/genai for in-app transcript AI).
# Fill in the registry addresses for your setup. @canva-ct/genai is an optional
# dependency: if it can't be installed, the app still builds and the
# "upload a transcript" button explains that the AI isn't set up.
# @canva:registry=https://<your-canva-registry>/
# @canva-ct:registry=https://<your-canva-ct-registry>/
